# agent-workflow (collab-finder)

> **Load rule:** Formal SoT below. Full orchestration: [agent-orchestrator](../skills/agent-orchestrator/SKILL.md). Verify rows: root `AGENTS.md`.

```text
Triage ∈ { single_shot, light, full }
escalate: single_shot → ~2 files or new unknowns → light | full

// Axioms
A1  Run VerifySoT yourself — never trust "done" without cmd exit 0
A2  Merge ≻ cp  ([git-worktrees](../skills/git-worktrees/SKILL.md))
A3  No LLM commit boilerplate unless user confirmed that LLM on this machine
A4  full → agent-orchestrator end-to-end
```

| Mode | When | Do |
|------|------|-----|
| **single_shot** | ≤2 files · obvious · low risk | edit + smallest AGENTS.md verify row |
| **light** | one concern · small scope | 3–5 bullets + implement |
| **full** | multi-agent · spike · merge · vague · verify other's "done" | orchestrator + brief + worktrees |

**Before commit (CommitGate):** `pnpm type-check` (TS) · `pnpm verify` (domain) · `cargo test` (Rust) · `pnpm gate` if unsure.
